1
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,778
Eightieth place—

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,210
Chen Dayou, of Qingzhou!

3
00:00:09,291 --> 00:00:10,666
Starting from last place

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,299
and reading up?

5
00:00:12,232 --> 00:00:13,517
Eighty names,

6
00:00:13,798 --> 00:00:14,678
we just wait it out.

7
00:00:15,686 --> 00:00:16,636
Well,

8
00:00:16,698 --> 00:00:19,924
Scholar Xu came to see the list too?

9
00:00:21,736 --> 00:00:23,450
If he passes,

10
00:00:23,691 --> 00:00:25,496
I'll walk backwards!

11
00:00:25,573 --> 00:00:26,953
Squire,

12
00:00:27,044 --> 00:00:28,060
lace your shoes up tight first.

13
00:00:28,122 --> 00:00:28,577
It's a deal,

14
00:00:29,177 --> 00:00:30,875
backwards down a whole street.

15
00:00:30,943 --> 00:00:32,808
Everyone heard that.

16
00:00:39,138 --> 00:00:40,077
The name struck out is…

17
00:00:41,731 --> 00:00:42,920
Examiner Feng!

18
00:00:43,781 --> 00:00:47,098
S-so they struck off one examiner,

19
00:00:47,198 --> 00:00:48,975
so what.

20
00:00:50,741 --> 00:00:51,393
The examiner's struck off,

21
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:52,391
but the list?

22
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,959
Tenth place—

23
00:00:54,244 --> 00:00:57,463
Lin Shi'an, of the city!

24
00:00:57,844 --> 00:00:59,240
Third place—

25
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:02,801
Li Shouzheng, of Qingzhou!

26
00:01:04,429 --> 00:01:05,744
Second place—

27
00:01:05,807 --> 00:01:09,092
Zhao Wenyuan, of the city!

28
00:01:09,171 --> 00:01:10,616
Ha ha ha!

29
00:01:12,382 --> 00:01:14,995
He's not even in the top three!

30
00:01:15,068 --> 00:01:16,211
Hurry up and read…

31
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:19,634
Aren't you nervous?

32
00:01:19,690 --> 00:01:20,265
I am.

33
00:01:20,324 --> 00:01:22,395
My palms are soaked.

34
00:01:23,246 --> 00:01:24,768
Jieyuan—

35
00:01:24,833 --> 00:01:27,882
Liuxi, Qingshui County,

36
00:01:27,963 --> 00:01:29,767
Xu Yan!

37
00:01:29,829 --> 00:01:31,147
…Me?

38
00:01:33,029 --> 00:01:33,569
You passed!

39
00:01:33,907 --> 00:01:34,709
Jieyuan! First place!

40
00:01:35,155 --> 00:01:36,665
I knew it.

41
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:39,478
Provincial exam mission complete.

42
00:01:39,549 --> 00:01:42,604
Reward: movable-type printing.

43
00:01:42,687 --> 00:01:44,043
Movable type…

44
00:01:44,132 --> 00:01:45,725
I'll have to find a type carver.

45
00:01:47,354 --> 00:01:47,962
Excuse me…

46
00:01:48,263 --> 00:01:49,941
Excuse me…

47
00:01:50,011 --> 00:01:51,134
Only halfway there,

48
00:01:51,216 --> 00:01:52,187
keep going, Squire!

49
00:01:52,899 --> 00:01:53,490
I…

50
00:01:53,854 --> 00:01:56,344
I'll walk it, all right!

51
00:01:56,621 --> 00:01:57,531
The whole street,

52
00:01:57,718 --> 00:01:59,725
not one step short.

53
00:02:01,753 --> 00:02:02,214
Everyone,

54
00:02:02,312 --> 00:02:03,413
share the joy!

55
00:02:03,476 --> 00:02:04,421
Xu Yan!

56
00:02:04,637 --> 00:02:05,374
Over here!

57
00:02:07,682 --> 00:02:08,411
What is it?

58
00:02:09,059 --> 00:02:09,990
Tonight,

59
00:02:10,569 --> 00:02:11,677
I have something to tell you.
